  "description": {
    "text": "The Noivern BREAK pack of the BREAK Evolution Packs, two fixed 12-card packs released on 26 September 2015 so players could try BREAK Evolution, new in the XY BREAK series, straight away. Each holds a BREAK card with the evolution line it needs and cards that help it, ready to go into a deck: here Noibat, Noivern and Noivern BREAK, whose attack can deal big damage when its condition is met.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon Card Game official site, archived: BREAK進化パック「ライチュウBREAK」「オンバーンBREAK」",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20150814235044/http://www.pokemon-card.com/products/xy/snp.html"
      },
      {
